fold scale-across and another 10-fold scale-up.\\n    Quote: If all \\\"scale-up\\\" goes fully optical in the bullish scenario she envisioned, or another 10 times on top of the 10 times growth in scale-across, that's a total addressable market growth of 100 times.\\n- e4968 [party_statement; Jim Cramer, quoted by Yahoo Finance from his CNBC remarks; original source Hock Tan, Broadcom CEO 2026-09-17; from gnews:ad29d60c2dff48278b88758a 2026-09-18] Broadcom CEO Hock Tan said demand for AI-development and inference compute infrastructure was extremely strong and durable; the item attributes the remark to his Mad Money appearance the previous night.\\n    Quote: We see the demand for compute infrastructure for development of AI and inference as extremely strong and durable.\\n- e4969 [third_party_view; Jim Cramer, quoted by Yahoo Finance from his CNBC remarks; original source Jim Cramer 2026-09-18; from gnews:ad29d60c2dff48278b88758a 2026-09-18] Jim Cramer said Broadcom CEO Hock Tan had more orders than almost anybody other than NVIDIA CEO Jensen Huang.\\n    Quote: this man has more orders than almost anybody other than Jensen Huang.\\n- e4970 [fact; Yahoo Finance; original source Broadcom 2026-09-02; from gnews:ad29d60c2dff48278b88758a 2026-09-18] Broadcom reported that quarterly revenue grew 86% year over year and AI semiconductor revenue grew 221%; the item does not specify the quarter\\u2019s end date.\\n    Quote: during the quarter, the firm's revenue grew by 86%, AI semiconductor revenue jumped by 221%\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e4002; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\\n- e4971 [party_statement; Yahoo Finance; original source Broadcom 2026-09-02; from gnews:ad29d60c2dff48278b88758a 2026-09-18] Broadcom\\u2019s FY2026 guidance implied 186% annual growth in AI revenue.\\n    Quote: fiscal year 2026 guidance implied 186% annual AI revenue growth.\\n- e4972 [party_statement; Yahoo Finance; original source 