), which sits in rung 3. NVIDIA's approximately $91B Q2 total-revenue guidance, assuming no China Data Center revenue, is a near-term reference, not a full-year estimate.\\\"), ('v9', '2026-07-24', 1649, \\\"Approximately $372B, in rung 3, using FY2026 Data Center revenue of $193.7B carried forward at FY2027 Q1's 92% year-over-year growth rate; no separate consensus estimate is supplied.\\\"), ('v9', '2026-07-25', 1717, \\\"No explicit consensus estimate is supplied. The reference is about $372B, calculated as FY2026 Data Center revenue of $193.7B carried forward at FY2027 Q1's 92% year-over-year growth rate; this is rung 3.\\\"), ('v9', '2026-07-26', 1787, \\\"Market reference: about $372 billion, in rung 3, based on FY2026 Data Center revenue of $193.7 billion carried forward at FY2027 Q1's 92% year-over-year growth rate.\\\"), ('v9', '2026-07-27', 2013, 'About $372 billion, in rung 3, using FY2026 Data Center revenue of $193.7 billion carried forward at the 92% year-over-year growth reported for FY2027 Q1. No separate consensus figure is supplied.'), ('v9', '2026-08-17', 3608, \\\"About $372B, in rung 3: FY2026 Data Center revenue of $193.7B carried forward at FY2027 Q1's 92% year-over-year growth; this is the run-rate reference, not the forecast.\\\"), ('v9', '2026-08-18', 3747, 'Approximately $372B, the market expectation stated in the previous conclusion; that lies in rung 3 ($350B to below $400B).'), ('v9', '2026-08-19', 3874, 'Approximately $372B, in rung 3 ($350B to below $400B), as the market/reference estimate carried forward from FY2026 Data Center revenue at the reported FY2027 Q1 year-over-year growth rate.'), ('v9', '2026-08-21', 3993, 'Approximately $372B, as carried from the prior conclusion; that reference sits in rung 3 ($350B to below $400B).'), ('v9', '2026-08-22', 4029, 'Approximately $372B, based on FY2026 Data Center revenue of $193.7B carried forward at 92% growth; this reference is in rung 3.'), ('v9', '2026-08-24', 4283, 'The market reference carried from the previous judgement is approximately $372B, derived there from FY2026 Data Center revenue of $193.7B carried forward at the reported 92% growth rate; this sits in rung 3 ($350B to below $400B). No new FY2027 consensus figure is supplied.'), ('v9', '2026-08-25', 4437, 'The carried market expectation is approximately $372B for FY2027 Data Center revenue, which is rung 3 ($350B to below $400B).'), ('v9', '2026-08-26', 4944, 'The carried market reference is approximately $372B for FY2027 Data Center revenue, at rung 3 ($350B to below $400B).'), ('v9', '2026-08-27', 5139, 'The carried market reference is approximately $372 billion, on rung 3 (Neutral: $350 billion to below $400 billion).')] [('v9', '2026-09-13', 7770, 'Approximately $372 billion, the market reference carried from the prior conclusion; this sits at rung 3.'), ('v9', '2026-09-14', 7939, 'The market reference carried from the previous judgement is approximately $372 billion, which sits in rung 3 ($350 billion to below $400 billion).'), ('v9', '2026-09-16', 8206, 'The approximately $414 billion FY2027 expectation carried from the previous conclusion is the reference; it sits at rung 2 ($400 billion to below $450 billion).'), ('v9', '2026-09-20', 8737, 'The market reference supplied by the previous conclusion is approximately $414 billion for FY2027, which sits at rung 2 ($400 billion to below $450 billion).')]\\ncontrol 3 v41 2026-09-20 [Decimal('38'), Decimal('39'), Decimal('40')] [('38', False), ('39', False), ('40', False)] [Decimal('20'), Decimal('40')]\\n3 {'all-USD': 641, 'parsed-USD': 641, 'at least one new-USD': 463, 'previous': 731, 'parsed-ref': 699, 'lead no nearby-USD': 283, 'lead no quote nearby-USD': 286, 'no nearby at all-USD': 25, 'hidden': 495, 'all-percent': 108, 'parsed-percent': 108, 'lead no nearby-percent': 36, 'lead no quote nearby-percent': 56, 'no nearby at all-percent': 3, 'at least one new-percent': 45, 'own and no evidence': 8} {'all-USD': '2026-07-01', 'parsed