ds_only:\n  f={f['\\\\''id'\\\\''] for f in d['\\\\''figures'\\\\'']}\n  for k,v,obj in fields(d):\n   if v is not None and v not in allowed(k,f,q): print('\\\\''BAD FIELD'\\\\'',k,repr(v),obj.get('\\\\''id'\\\\'',obj.get('\\\\''view_id'\\\\'')))\nshow('\\\\''retries'\\\\'',12,(),('\\\\''e3943'\\\\'','\\\\''e2115'\\\\'','\\\\''e2499'\\\\'','\\\\''e2468'\\\\'','\\\\''e2116'\\\\''))\nshow('\\\\''retries'\\\\'',44,(),('\\\\''e2620'\\\\'','\\\\''e2889'\\\\'','\\\\''e3970'\\\\'','\\\\''e4486'\\\\''))\nshow('\\\\''retries'\\\\'',72,(),('\\\\''e4856'\\\\'',))\nshow('\\\\''retries'\\\\'',60,('\\\\''f_q3_total'\\\\'','\\\\''f_q3_dc'\\\\'','\\\\''e_q4_total'\\\\'','\\\\''e_q4_dc'\\\\'','\\\\''f_fy27_dc'\\\\''),())\nshow('\\\\''answers'\\\\'',44,(),('\\\\''e2620'\\\\'','\\\\''e2889'\\\\'','\\\\''e4486'\\\\''))'\"","aggregated_output":"\n retries 12 pair-old-2 separate-v9 1 ERRORS [['C1', 'dc_h1_reported: value 164 USD billions bound None does not equal \"$164 billion\" as component value'], ['C1', 'dc_share_q2: value 92.5 percent bound None does not equal \"92.5%\" as component value'], ['C1', 'total_q3_guidance: value 108 USD billions bound None does not equal \"$108.0 billion, plus or minus 2%\" as component midpoint'], ['C1', 'q3_sequential_growth: \"12% sequential growth at the midpoint\" is not a complete numeric expression of e3943'], ['C1', 'morningstar_dc_reference: \"well over $300 billion\" is not a complete numeric expression of e2115'], ['C2', \"dc_q3_forecast: declared 99.9–99.9 but product of ['total_q3_guidance', 'dc_share_q2'] gives 9990.00–9990.00\"], ['C2', \"dc_q4_forecast: declared 111.888–111.888 but product of ['total_q4_forecast', 'dc_share_q2'] gives 11188.80–11188.80\"], ['C8', 'total_q4_forecast: converts total_q3_guidance, q3_sequential_growth to NVIDIA company FY2027 Q4 revenue with no bridge naming those operands'], ['C8', 'dc_q3_forecast: converts total_q3_guidance, dc_share_q2 to NVIDIA Data Center FY2027 Q3 revenue with no bridge naming those operands'], ['C8', 'dc_q4_forecast: converts total_q4_forecast, dc_share_q2 to NVIDIA Data Center FY2027 Q4 revenue with no bridge naming those operands'], ['C8', 'dc_fy27_forecast: time aggregation needs one quantity over disjoint periods forming FY2027'], ['C7', 'v9: outcome About $376 billion of FY2027 Data Center revenue. is not a figure']]\n{'id': 'dc_h1_reported', 'what': {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027 first six months'}, 'basis': 'reported', 'scenario': 'base', 'kind': 'source', 'value': 164, 'unit': 'USD billions', 'evidence': 'e4995', 'expression': '$164 billion', 'component': 'value', 'basis_text': 'Reported first-half Data Center revenue.'}\n{'id': 'dc_share_q2', 'what': {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'share of company revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027 Q2'}, 'basis': 'third_party', 'scenario': 'base', 'kind': 'source', 'value': 92.5, 'unit': 'percent', 'evidence': 'e3216', 'expression': '92.5%', 'component': 'value', 'basis_text': 'Reported-quarter Data Center share of total revenue.'}\n{'id': 'total_q3_guidance', 'what': {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q3'}, 'basis': 'guidance', 'scenario': 'base', 'kind': 'source', 'value': 108, 'unit': 'USD billions', 'evidence': 'e2499', 'expression': '$108.0 billion, plus or minus 2%', 'component': 'midpoint', 'basis_text': 'Company Q3 revenue guidance; midpoint used.'}\n{'id': 'q3_sequential_growth', 'what': {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue growth', 'scope': 'company, sequential', 'period': 'FY2027 Q3 guidance'}, 'basis': 'guidance', 'scenario': 'base', 'kind': 'source', 'value': 12, 'unit': 'percent', 'evidence': 'e3943', 'expression': '12% sequential growth at the midpoint', 'component': 'value', 'basis_text': 'Sequential growth implied by Q3 guidance.'}\n{'id': 'total_q4_forecast', 'what': {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'company', 'period': 'FY2027 Q4'}, 'basis': 'forecast', 'scenario': 'base', 'kind': 'computed', 'value': 120.96, 'unit': 'USD billions', 'component': 'value', 'inputs': ['total_q3_guidance', 'q3_sequential_growth'], 'operation': 'apply_growth', 'basis_text': 'Carries the Q3 guidance-implied sequential growth rate forward one quarter.', 'rests_on': ['total_q3_guidance', 'q3_sequential_growth']}\n{'id': 'dc_q3_forecast', 'what': {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027 Q3'}, 'basis': 'forecast', 'scenario': 'base', 'kind': 'computed', 'value': 99.9, 'unit': 'USD billions', 'component': 'value', 'inputs': ['total_q3_guidance', 'dc_share_q2'], 'operation': 'product', 'basis_text': 'Applies the latest reported Data Center revenue share to the Q3 total-revenue guidance midpoint.', 'rests_on': ['total_q3_guidance', 'dc_share_q2']}\n{'id': 'dc_q4_forecast', 'what': {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027 Q4'}, 'basis': 'forecast', 'scenario': 'base', 'kind': 'computed', 'value': 111.888, 'unit': 'USD billions', 'component': 'value', 'inputs': ['total_q4_forecast', 'dc_share_q2'], 'operation': 'product', 'basis_text': 'Applies the latest reported Data Center revenue share to the Q4 company-revenue run-rate forecast.', 'rests_on': ['total_q4_forecast', 'dc_share_q2']}\n{'id': 'dc_fy27_forecast', 'what': {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027'}, 'basis': 'forecast', 'scenario': 'base', 'kind': 'computed', 'value': 375.788, 'unit': 'USD billions', 'component': 'value', 'inputs': ['dc_h1_reported', 'dc_q3_forecast', 'dc_q4_forecast'], 'operation': 'sum', 'signs': [1, 1, 1], 'relation': 'time_aggregation', 'basis_text': 'FY2027 first-half reported revenue plus the Q3 and Q4 forecasts.', 'rests_on': ['dc_h1_reported', 'dc_q3_forecast', 'dc_q4_forecast']}\n{'id': 'morningstar_dc_reference', 'what': {'population': 'NVIDIA', 'measure': 'revenue', 'scope': 'Data Center', 'period': 'FY2027'}, 'basis': 'third_party', 'scenario': 'external reference', 'kind': 'source', 'value': 300, 'bound': '>', 'unit': 'USD billions', 'evidence': 'e2115', 'expression': 'well over $300 billion', 'component': 'bound', 'basis_text': 'Morningstar estimate for fiscal 2027.'}\nANS {'view_id': 'v9', 'outcome': 'About $376 billion of FY2027 Data Center revenue.', 'reference': {'figure': \"Morningstar's estimate is “well over $300 billion” (e2115), placing its stated lower threshold at rung 4; it does not provide an upper bound that fixes a single rung.\", 'unavailable': 'No specific FY2027 Data Center consensus figure is shown.'}, 'cites': ['e4995', 'e3216', 'e2499', 'e3943', 'e3222', 'e4052', 'e2572', 'e4769', 'e4511', 'e4512', 'e1336', 'e2115'], 'rung': 3}\ne3943 QUOTE In the meantime, Nvidia's fiscal 2027 third-quarter guidance implies 12% sequential growth at the midpoint.\n  HEADER - e3943 [party_statement; The Motley Fool author; original source NVIDIA ; from gnews:89698c9955cf8aa35b642970 2026-09-04] NVIDIA's FY2027 Q3 guidance implied total revenue growth of 12% sequentially at the midpoint.\ne2115 QUOTE Nvidia should generate well over $300 billion of data center revenue in calendar 2026, which is effectively fiscal 2027, and perhaps over $500 billion in fiscal 2028.\n  HEADER - e2115 [third_party_view; Morningstar; original source Morningstar 2026-08-19; from gnews:7ce47efd62fa17b9aa29e258 2026-08-19] Morningstar estimates NVIDIA Data Center revenue will exceed $300 billion in FY2027 and perhaps $500 billion in FY2028.\ne2499 QUOTE Revenue is expected to be $108.0 billion, plus or minus 2%. NVIDIA is not assuming any Data Center compute revenue from China in its outlook.\n  HEADER - e2499 [party_statement; NVIDIA Corporation; original source NVIDIA Corporation 2026-08-26; from nvidianews:nvidia-announces-financial-results-for-second-quarter-fiscal-2027 2026-08-26] NVIDIA guided Q3 FY2027 revenue to $108.0 billion, plus or minus 2%, assuming no