C7: outcome missing': 1, 'C7: point/range': 1}\nsingle-S {'C7: dangling': 3, 'C7: point/range': 1, 'C7: signs': 1}\nsingle-E {'C7: point/range': 2, 'C7: signs': 1, 'C7: dangling': 1}\nretries clears early 25 clears all C7 9\njoint cost 0.071633\nseparate cost 0.11833099999999999\nsingle cost 0.022396999999999997\nsingle-O {'C1: value/unit/etc': 2, 'C7: outcome missing': 2, 'C1: evidence': 3, 'C2: bound': 1, 'C8: f4: overlap_unknown must name a disputed operand among its inputs': 1, 'C7: point/range': 1, 'C7: dangling': 1}\nsingle-S {'C7: dangling': 3, 'C7: signs': 1}\nsingle-E {'C7: arity': 1, 'C7: signs': 2, 'C1: value/unit/etc': 1, 'C1: expression': 1, 'C8: bridge': 1, 'C7: outcome missing': 1}\nperiod only removed {('C8', 'f8: time aggregation needs one quantity over disjoint periods forming FY2027')} added set()\none percent product -> share removed {('C1', 'dc_share_q2: value 92.5 percent bound None does not equal \"92.5%\" as component value'), ('C8', 'dc_q4_forecast: converts total_q4_forecast, dc_share_q2 to NVIDIA Data Center FY2027 Q4 revenue with no bridge naming those operands'), ('C2', \"dc_q3_forecast: declared 99.9–99.9 but product of ['total_q3_guidance', 'dc_share_q2'] gives 9990.00–9990.00\"), ('C8', 'dc_q3_forecast: converts total_q3_guidance, dc_share_q2 to NVIDIA Data Center FY2027 Q3 revenue with no bridge naming those operands')} added {('C8', 'dc_q4_forecast: converts total_q4_forecast to NVIDIA Data Center FY2027 Q4 revenue with no bridge naming those operands')}\ne3558 QUOTE The deal announced on Monday will see Nvidia buy bonds convertible into MediaTek shares.\n  HEADER - e3558 [fact; sg.finance.yahoo.com; original source NVIDIA ; from gnews:0849c71e57d8603a7cbf08e0 2026-08-31] NVIDIA announced it would buy US$3.5 billion of MediaTek bonds convertible into shares; the deal was announced Monday.\ne2452 QUOTE For Q4 FY 2026, Nvidia expected $65 billion in revenue; it ended up producing $68 billion.\n  HEADER - e2452 [party_statement; fool.com (analyst); original source NVIDIA ; from gnews:835fa8a6ac898ca3973d586c 2026-08-23] NVIDIA guided to $65 billion in Q4 FY2026 revenue and reported actual revenue of $68 billion.\ne5162 QUOTE and 65% growth in Q4.\n  HEADER - e5162 [third_party_view; fool.com author; original source Wall Street analysts ; from gnews:ea4633ed3e4ad9d71383673f 2026-09-17] Wall Street analysts expect NVIDIA revenue to grow 65% year over year in FY2027 Q4.\ne4856 QUOTE with the potential to more than double that number in fiscal year 2028.\n  HEADER - e4856 [party_statement; fool.com (analyst); original source NVIDIA management ; from gnews:c70bc12967b9b53426b5fb10 2026-09-12] NVIDIA management said Vera CPU revenue in FY2028 could be more than double the $20 billion potential it cited for FY2027.\ne3660 QUOTE The bad news for AMD and Intel is that Kress said Nvidia not only still expects $20 billion in CPU revenue in its fiscal 2027, but expects that number to more than double in fiscal 2028.\n  HEADER - e3660 [party_statement; Bram Berkowitz, fool.com, reporting Colette Kress's statement; original source NVIDIA CFO Colette Kress ; from gnews:fd25a8ea6f60290264bfbe55 2026-08-30] NVIDIA CFO Colette Kress said NVIDIA still expects $20 billion of CPU revenue in FY2027 and expects FY2028 CPU revenue to more than double that amount.\nanswers 2 raw errors [['C7', 'f_fy27_q3_guide: a figure needs either a value or a complete range with low at most high'], ['C7', 'f_fy26_q1_est refers to Estimate the prior-year quarter by dividing reported FY2027 Q1 revenue by 1 plus its reported year-over-year growth., which is not defined'], ['C7', 'f_fy26_q2_est refers to Estimate the prior-year quarter by dividing reported FY2027 Q2 revenue by 1 plus its reported year-over-year growth., which is not defined'], ['C7', 'f_fy26_q4_est refers to Estimate FY2026 Q4 as FY2026 full-year revenue less the three reconstructed or reported FY2026 Q1–Q3 amounts., which is not defined'], ['C7', 'f_fy27_q4_est refers to Apply the analyst-stated 65% year-over-year Q4 growth expectation to the estimated FY2026 Q4 base., which is not defined'], ['C7', 'f_fy27_total_est refers to Sum reported FY2027 Q1 and Q2, the Q3 guidance midpoint, and the estimated FY2027 Q4 amount., which is not defined'], ['C7', 'f_fy27_dc_q3_est refers to Multiply the Q3 total-revenue guidance midpoint by the latest reported Data Center share of total revenue., which is not defined'], ['C7', \"f_dc_q4_mix_est refers to Estimate a modest 0.5 percentage-point increase from the latest 92.5% Data Center mix, reflecting its recent upward trend and management's expectation of stronger hyperscale growth in Q4., which is not defined\"], ['C7', 'f_fy27_dc_q4_est refers to Multiply estimated FY2027 Q4 company revenue by the estimated 93% Data Center share., which is not defined']]\nanswers 12 raw errors [['C7', 'total_fy27_q3_guidance: a figure needs either a value or a complete range with low at most high'], ['C7', 'total_fy27_q4_implied: difference takes 2 operands, not 4'], ['C7', 'total_fy27_q4_implied: signs must give one +1 or -1 per operand of a sum or roll_forward'], ['C7', 'dc_fy27_q3_forecast refers to Estimate Q3 Data Center revenue by applying the latest reported 92.5% Data Center share to the $108 billion Q3 total-revenue guidance., which is not defined'], ['C7', 'dc_fy27_q4_forecast refers to Estimate Q4 Data Center revenue by applying the latest reported 92.5% Data Center share to the $125.2 billion Q4 company-revenue residual., which is not defined']]\nretries 12 first reasons [['C7', 'total_fy27_q3_guidance: a figure needs either a value or a complete range with low at most high'], ['C7', 'total_fy27_q4_implied: difference takes 2 operands, not 4'], ['C7', 'total_fy27_q4_implied: signs must give one +1 or -1 per operand of a sum or roll_forward'], ['C7', 'dc_fy27_q3_forecast refers to Estimate Q3 Data Center revenue by applying the latest reported 92.5% Data Center share to the $108 billion Q3 total-revenue guidance., which is not defined'], ['C7', 'dc_fy27_q4_forecast refers to Estimate Q4 Data Center revenue by applying the latest reported 92.5% Data Center share to the $125.2 billion Q4 company-revenue residual., which is not defined']]\nretries 66 first reasons [['C7', 'f4: a figure needs either a value or a complete range with low at most high'], ['C7', 'f6 refers to My estimate applies about 12% sequential growth to the Q3 Data Center estimate of approximately $100 billion, giving about $112 billion for Q4. The 12% is a run-rate assumption, not Q4 guidance; the qualitative Q4 hyperscale acceleration supports carrying growth forward., which is not defined']]\nretries 44 first reasons [['C1', 'f1: value 25 USD billions bound None does not equal \"$25 billion\" as component value'], ['C1', 'f2: \"$18 billion committed to equity investments for the rest of its fiscal year\" is not a complete numeric expression of e2889'], ['C1', 'f4: \"$30 billion each from Nvidia and SoftBank\" is not a complete numeric expression of e4486'], ['C7', 'v29: outcome Approximately $30 billion in equity investment commitments at the end of FY2027 (my estimate). is not a figure']]\nretries 60 first reasons [['C7', 'f_q3_total: a figure needs either a value or a complete range with low at most high'], ['C7', 'f_q3_dc refers to Estimate Q3 Data Center revenue by applying the latest reported Data Center share of 92.5% to the Q3 company revenue guidance midpoint., which is not defined'], ['C7', \"f_q4_total refers to My estimate carries forward 15% sequential growth from Q3, above the 12% midpoint growth implied by Q3 guidance, reflecting management's stated Q4 hyperscale reacceleration as Vera Rubin supply builds., which is not defined\"], ['C7', 'f_q4_dc: roll_forward takes 2 to 99 operands, not 1'], ['C7', 'f_q4_dc refers to My estimate applies 15% sequential growth to Q3 Data Center revenue, consistent with the estimated companywide Q4 growth and the latest Data Center revenue mix., which is not defined']]\nretries 72 first reasons [['C7', 'f_fy28_guidance_threshold: signs must give one +1 or -1 per operand of a sum or roll_forward'], ['C7', 'f_fy28_guidance_threshold refers to Applying the stated more-than-2x FY2028 multiplier to the $20 billion FY2027 CPU revenue expectation gives a lower threshold above $40 billion; the Vera-specific FY2028 statement supports applying that growth expectation to Vera CPU., which is not defined']]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
